  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: df52e01750a2d85499dcca6bb2284122, type: 3}
  m_Name: EVD_SaleContract
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TLA.Data::TLA.Data.Evidence.EvidenceDefinition
  evidenceId: EVD_SaleContract
  displayName: Draft sale agreement
  category: 0
  description: 'A confidential draft: Reyes planned to sell his majority share of
    the firm.'
  locationFound: "Evidence Room \xB7 open folder on the desk"
  interactionPrompt: Read document
  pages:
  - "HEADS OF TERMS  \xB7  DRAFT 3  \xB7  STRICTLY CONFIDENTIAL\n\nBetween: Daniel
    Reyes, holder of 60% of Reyes & Marlowe Architects Ltd\nand: Calder Holdings
    plc\n\nCalder Holdings to acquire Mr Reyes's entire holding. Completion planned
    for the end of the month."
  - '4. MANAGEMENT

    On completion, Calder Holdings will appoint the board. The
    position of the remaining partner (E. Marlowe) will be reviewed within 12 months.


    Signed 
    D. Reyes ..................  (unsigned)

    Signed for Calder Holdings .................. 
    (unsigned)


    In the margin, handwritten: "Tell E. after the 20th."'
  image: {fileID: 0}
  caption: 
  examinationNotes: 'The margin note is in Reyes''s handwriting: "Tell E. after the
    20th." He was keeping the sale from Marlowe. There''s a coffee ring on the last
    page.'
  relatedFacts:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 877c7a9cbda8bd742ae8651f51b8e454, type: 2}
  collectable: 1
  noteOnCollect: 
  objectiveOnCollect: 
